#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:21
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:23
msgid "The StopWatch firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, ``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, ``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, ``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr "StopWatch 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat 字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44`` 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:30
msgid "For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, ``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and Korean text respectively."
msgstr "对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 ``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

