#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:34
#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:82
msgid "RTC Clock"
msgstr "RTC 时钟"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:36
msgid "Open the |stopwatch_rtc_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |stopwatch_rtc_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:38
#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:84
msgid ""
"This example displays a digital clock (HH:MM:SS) on the round screen, "
"reading time from the built-in RTC. Press **BtnA** to cycle through hour,"
" minute, and second adjustment modes (the active field is highlighted in "
"red). Press **BtnB** to increment the selected field. After adjusting "
"seconds, press **BtnA** again to write the new time to the RTC."
msgstr ""
"此示例在圆形屏幕上显示数字时钟（HH:MM:SS），时间来自内置 RTC。按 **BtnA** "
"可循环切换时、分、秒的调节模式（当前字段以红色高亮）。按 **BtnB** 可增加所选字段的数值。调节完秒后，再次按 **BtnA** "
"将新时间写入 RTC。"

