msgid "Audio Recording and Playback"
msgstr "录音与播放"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:66
msgid "Open the |stopwatch_aduio_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |stopwatch_aduio_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:68
#: ../../source/controllers/stopwatch.rst:114
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates audio recording and playback. Press **BtnA** to"
" start a 5-second recording (countdown shown on screen). Press **BtnB** "
"to play back the recorded file when not recording. The UI shows **Idle**,"
" **Recording...**, or **Playing...** status."
msgstr ""
"此示例演示录音与播放。按 **BtnA** 开始录制 5 秒（屏幕显示倒计时）。未在录制时按 **BtnB** 播放已录制的文件。界面显示 "
"**Idle**、**Recording...** 或 **Playing...** 状态。"

